                                                "sense_id": "623ab334-ec3d-3360-98a5-0b5405d8a525",
                                                "text": "Syntactically, hendiadic constructions differ from synthetonic sequences in that the latter are separate clauses, and hence are separately negatable and may have different tenses and aspects and different subjects."
